    "versions": {
      "leb": [
        {
          "book": "Deut",
          "chapter": 33,
          "verse": 22,
          "text": "And of Dan he said,\n“Dan is a cub of a lion;\nhe leaps from Bashan.”",
          "isHeading": false
        },
        {
          "book": "Deut",
          "chapter": 33,
          "verse": 23,
          "text": "And of Naphtali, he said,\n“Oh, Naphtali, sated of favor,\nand full of the blessing of Yahweh;\ntake possession of the lake,\nand the land to the south.”",
          "isHeading": false
        },
        {
          "book": "Deut",
          "chapter": 33,
          "verse": 24,
          "text": "And of Asher he said,\n“Blessed more than sons is Asher;\nmay he be the favorite of his brothers,\ndipping his feet in the oil.",
          "isHeading": false
        },
        {
          "book": "Deut",
          "chapter": 33,
          "verse": 25,
          "text": "Your bars are iron and bronze,\nand as your days, so is your strength.”",
          "isHeading": false
        },
        {
          "book": "Deut",
          "chapter": 33,
          "verse": 26,
          "text": "“There is no one like God, O, Jeshurun,\nwho rides through the heavens to your help,\nand with his majesty through the skies.",
          "isHeading": false
        }
      ],
      "nirv": [
        {
          "book": "Deut",
          "chapter": 33,
          "verse": 22,
          "text": "Here’s what Moses said about Dan.\n“Dan is like a lion’s cub\nthat charges out of the land of Bashan.”",
          "isHeading": false
        },
        {
          "book": "Deut",
          "chapter": 33,
          "verse": 23,
          "text": "Here’s what Moses said about Naphtali.\n“The Lord greatly favors Naphtali.\nThe Lord fills him with his blessing.\nNaphtali’s land will reach south to the Sea of Galilee.”",
          "isHeading": false
        },
        {
          "book": "Deut",
          "chapter": 33,
          "verse": 24,
          "text": "Here’s what Moses said about Asher.\n“Asher is the most blessed of sons.\nLet his brothers show favor to him.\nLet him wash his feet with olive oil.",
          "isHeading": false
        },
        {
          "book": "Deut",
          "chapter": 33,
          "verse": 25,
          "text": "The bars of his gates will be made out of iron and bronze.\nHis strength will last as long as he lives.",
          "isHeading": false
        },
        {
          "book": "Deut",
          "chapter": 33,
          "verse": 26,
          "text": "“There is no one like the God of Israel.\nHe rides in the heavens to help you.\nHe rides on the clouds in his glory.",
          "isHeading": false
        }
      ],
